            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He is distinguished by his **\"consciousness-touch,\"** a specialized ability that allows him to interface directly with the ground to assess bedrock stability, mineral composition, and \"vrill-flow\".",
